;;; The gnome's figure as it was tuned on 2026-08-19, the day the knobs were
;;; added, dumped over Slynk as (GROUP NAME VALUE).  All eighteen moved, and
;;; all eighteen became the defaults in that commit.
;;;
;;; Four values came off the metabar carrying single-float step noise --
;;; 0.39999998, 0.22999999, 0.35999998, 0.099999994 -- and were written to
;;; the grid their own steps land on: 0.40, 0.23, 0.36, 0.10.
